      "id": "claim_8c47e3fe2aca4ce79f9978224cb17f6f",
      "statement": "Each peer generates its own RSA-OAEP-2048 key pair when creating its outgoing artifact, holding the private key in page state; the offer peer mints the pair exactly once per generateOfferLink() invocation at the top (before the peer is created) so the ICE-candidate timeout build path can never re-mint a key that no longer matches the link's `p` param, and the answer peer awaits the validated p-param import before generating the answer's pair.",
