      "id": "claim_8667dbdd503444ae80a6ed368d17f68b",
      "statement": "AES-256-GCM payload encryption uses a fresh random 12-byte IV per chunk: encryptAesGcm returns IV || ciphertext and decryptAesGcm splits the first 12 bytes as the IV, so each chunk is encrypted with a unique nonce.",
